## Bronze Layer

The Bronze Layer stores raw data collected from CRM and ERP source systems.
The data is loaded into this layer with minimal transformation to preserve the
original source data.

### CRM Tables

#### crm_cust_info
Stores customer information from the CRM system, including customer ID,
customer key, name, marital status, gender, and creation date.

#### crm_prd_info
Stores product information from the CRM system, including product ID,
product key, product name, cost, product line, and product validity dates.

#### crm_sales_detail
Stores sales transaction details from the CRM system, including order number,
product key, customer ID, order date, shipping date, due date, sales amount,
quantity, and price.

### ERP Tables

#### erp_cust_az12
Stores customer-related information from the ERP system, including customer ID,
birth date, and gender.

#### erp_loc_a101
Stores customer location information from the ERP system, including customer ID
and country.

#### erp_px_cat_g1v2
Stores product category information from the ERP system, including product ID,
category, subcategory, and maintenance information.
